# Ignored datasets, records, models, secrets, outputs, and developer-local state
# are registered in docs/setup/local_resources_manifest_v1.json. When a durable
# local-resource rule changes, update that manifest, LOCAL_RESOURCES.md, and its
# focused test in the same commit.
__pycache__
.idea/
data/
# The unanchored data rule also matches documentation taxonomy directories.
# Keep real data ignored while allowing versioned documentation under docs/data.
